---
import "./series-visual.css";
---

<figure
  class="mcp-flow series-visual not-prose"
  aria-labelledby="mcp-flow-title"
>
  <figcaption id="mcp-flow-title">
    一次天气查询：结果怎样成为回答的依据
  </figcaption>
  <ol class="steps" role="list">
    <li>
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <p class="route">
          <strong class="agent">Agent 应用</strong>
          <span role="img" aria-label="发送给">→</span>
          <strong>模型</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          提交“杭州明天要带伞吗？”和 <code>weather_get_forecast</code> 的工具说明。
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <p class="route">
          <strong>模型</strong>
          <span role="img" aria-label="发送给">→</span>
          <strong class="agent">Agent 应用</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          选择调用 <code>weather_get_forecast</code>，参数 <code>city</code> 为“杭州”。
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="mcp-step">
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <p class="route">
          <strong class="agent">Agent 应用</strong>
          <span role="img" aria-label="发送给">→</span>
          <strong class="server">weather 服务</strong>
        </p>
        <p>通过 MCP 调用 <code>get_forecast</code>，查询杭州明天的天气。</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="mcp-step">
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <p class="route">
          <strong class="server">weather 服务</strong>
          <span role="img" aria-label="发送给">→</span>
          <strong class="agent">Agent 应用</strong>
        </p>
        <p>返回“杭州明天：小雨，气温 18—23℃”。</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <p class="route">
          <strong class="agent">Agent 应用</strong>
          <span role="img" aria-label="发送给">→</span>
          <strong>模型</strong>
        </p>
        <p>先将工具结果写入历史，再提交包含这份天气预报的对话。</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="answer-step">
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">6</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <p class="route">
          <strong>模型</strong>
          <span role="img" aria-label="发送给">→</span>
          <strong class="agent">Agent 应用</strong>
        </p>
        <p>根据“小雨”预报生成回答：“明天有小雨，出门建议带伞。”</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="caption">
    图中的 Agent 应用以 Ink 为例，工具和天气数据均为教学示例。
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .mcp-flow {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: clamp(0.8rem, 3vw, 1.25rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
    color: var(--series-ink);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.65rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
  }
  .step-number {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.65rem;
    height: 1.65rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--series-paper);
    color: var(--series-blue);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .step-content {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .route {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .route > span {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .agent {
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .server,
  .mcp-step .step-number {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .answer-step {
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  code {
    white-space: normal;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .caption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
</style>
